TITLE:: InsightGUI
summary:: an insight in a window of its own
categories:: Libraries>Insight
related:: Classes/Insight, Classes/InsightPanel, Classes/FxDeviceGUI

DESCRIPTION::
The window link::Classes/Insight#-gui:: opens: an link::Classes/InsightPanel:: in FxDeviceGUI, the window every effect of the family has - the panel, then one line along the bottom with the hint at its left and, at its right, what the insight reads and whether it runs (code::bus 0 · 2 ch · 48 kHz · running::).

Running follows the window: it starts the analysis when it opens and stops it again when it closes, unless the insight was already running before.

code::
s.boot;
i = Insight(\main, 0, 2);
g = i.gui;                     // the same as InsightGUI(i)
g.panel.frozen = true;         // hold the picture
g.close;
::

CLASSMETHODS::

METHOD:: new
ARGUMENT:: unit
The link::Classes/Insight:: to show.
ARGUMENT:: x
Left edge of the window, or nil.
ARGUMENT:: y
Top edge of the window, or nil.

METHOD:: fmt
A reading with one decimal and its sign, code::"-inf":: for silence: what every number in the window uses.
ARGUMENT:: v
A number, or nil.

METHOD:: time
Seconds as code::"mm:ss"::.
ARGUMENT:: secs
A number.

INSTANCEMETHODS::

METHOD:: insight
The link::Classes/Insight:: shown.

METHOD:: panel
The link::Classes/InsightPanel::.

METHOD:: window
The Window.

METHOD:: hints
The hint strip along the bottom.

METHOD:: frozen
Whether the picture is held.

METHOD:: spectrumView
The spectrum pane, an link::Classes/InsightSpectrumView::.

METHOD:: meterView
The levels and loudness pane, an link::Classes/InsightMeterView::.

METHOD:: imagerView
The stereo pane, an link::Classes/InsightImagerView::.

METHOD:: historyView
The loudness history, an link::Classes/InsightHistoryView::.

METHOD:: front
Bring the window to the front.

METHOD:: close
Close it: the analysis stops unless it was running before the window opened.
